  #[#set math.equation(numbering: n => "(2.12)")
   $ \| v n +
     v' n' \| > R
     quad \( \| v \| \, \| v' \| lt.eq H \, med \( v \, v' \) eq.not \( 0 \, 0 \) \, med v \, v' in bb(Z) \) .
     $ <eq:power-separation>]
  Indeed, if $v' eq.not 0$, each previously chosen $n$ excludes at most $2 R +
