  #[#set math.equation(numbering: n => "(2.13)")
   $ bb(E) \[ u \( s \, { n lambda_i } \) u \( s \, { n' lambda_i } \) \] = macron(u) \( s \)^2 +
     O \( m^(- 50) \) quad \( n eq.not n' \) . $ <eq:two-power>]
